    <briefdescription>
<para>A <ref refid="classrr_1_1VulkanMesh" kindref="compound">VulkanMesh</ref> is a collection of <ref refid="structrr_1_1Vertex" kindref="compound">Vertex</ref> that makes some sort of shape. </para>
